# ---- compiled binaries ----
# you compile every solution as `test`, often inside the problem's folder
# (practice/800-1100/test), so keep this unanchored to match any depth
test
a.out
*.exe
*.o

# ---- editor / OS junk ----
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# NOTE: deliberately NOT ignoring *.in / *.out
# in competitive programming those are usually sample tests you want to keep.
